## Scope

The role read the Measure index, workflow, durable-job specification, plan,
strategy, Review B artifact, migration `0052`, PG16 harness and tests, and
anti-pattern catalog.

The role added one migration-governance Red test, one plan note, one evidence
note, and this role log. It changed no migration or production source.

## Red contract

The test creates both durable-job roles with `LOGIN CREATEDB` before migration.
It requires migration failure before protected ownership and grants, or requires
`NOLOGIN` for both roles before those objects remain assigned.

The successful path checks both audit table owners, the append-only trigger
function owner, and runtime privileges. The failure path checks no unsafe owner
and no runtime grant. The test removes only its created roles.

## Verification

Safe default passed one test with no PostgreSQL contact.

Disposable `docker.io/library/postgres:16-alpine` PostgreSQL `160014` ran the
contract on port `55441`. It produced one named failure:

```text
durable_job_audit_owner must be NOLOGIN before protected grants and ownership.:
expected true to be false
```

The run produced no other test failure. Cleanup returned zero scratch databases,
zero Task 9 roles, and removed the disposable container.

Focused TypeScript, package typecheck, package-local ESLint, Prettier, and the
targeted diff check passed.

## Green handoff

Green must update migration `0052` only after reviewing this contract.
The migration must fail closed or enforce and verify `NOLOGIN` before grants and
ownership. Green must rerun both recorded PG16 commands.

